<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>왜 JsonXcel인가 on JsonXcel Learn</title><link>https://jsonxcel.github.io/learn-jsonxcel/ko/learn/m01-why-jsonxcel/</link><description>Recent content in 왜 JsonXcel인가 on JsonXcel Learn</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>ko-KR</language><atom:link href="https://jsonxcel.github.io/learn-jsonxcel/ko/learn/m01-why-jsonxcel/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>코드 작성 vs 템플릿 분리</title><link>https://jsonxcel.github.io/learn-jsonxcel/ko/learn/m01-why-jsonxcel/m01-l01-code-vs-template/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://jsonxcel.github.io/learn-jsonxcel/ko/learn/m01-why-jsonxcel/m01-l01-code-vs-template/</guid><description>&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;이 페이지는 한국어 입구입니다. 상세 기술 설명은 당분간 영어/간체가 기준입니다. 마커·JSON 키·&lt;code&gt;template_name&lt;/code&gt;은 모든 언어에서 동일합니다.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;h2 id="learning-objectives"&gt;Learning objectives&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Explain the cost of painting worksheets in C# / Java / TypeScript&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Describe the JsonXcel boundary: &lt;strong&gt;Excel owns layout&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;JSON owns data&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;API owns conversion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify what belongs in a template versus what belongs in &lt;code&gt;ds&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
